(x1,n −x1,n)(x2,m −x2,m)(yn,m −yn,m)
(x1 −x1)(x2 −x2)(y−y)
, (3.9)
where the numerator sums the subvolumes defined by the N ×N subintervals for x1, x2, and
y, and the denominator is the area of the bounding box.
