Elongation [1.799, 1.809] [9.184, 10.044] 0.860
Thermal 4He Fraction [0.06, 0.066] [8.079, 9.217] 1.138
H-factor [1.269, 1.30] [7.929, 9.104] 1.175
W Impurity Fraction [10−5, 1.9×10−5] [8.177, 9.943] 1.766
Core Radius [0.70, 0.72] [8.078, 9.846] 1.767
